{
    "attributes": {
        "action": "Commission a further independent review of DVSA management of driving tests",
        "additional_details": "Background\r\n- Examine why recovery targets were missed.\r\n- Review DVSA leadership and planning.\r\n- Establish accountability for limited test access.\r\n- Publish recovery targets and progress reports.\r\n- Consult instructors and learners.\r\n- Improve the booking system quickly.\r\n- Review learner-only booking and test swaps.\r\n- Release tests regionally on different days.\r\n- Allocate test centres by home postcode.",
        "background": "Commission a further independent review of the Driver and Vehicle Standards Agency's (DVSA) management of driving tests.",
